<% if (page.type === 'tags') { %>
<section class="container collection-page"><header class="collection-header"><p class="section-kicker">THE CONSTELLATION / 灵感星图</p><h1>让好奇，自由连接<span>。</span></h1><p>沿着一个标签，发现新的方向。</p></header><div class="tags-directory"><% site.tags.sort('length', -1).each(tag => { %><a href="<%= url_for(tag.path) %>"><span>#</span><h2><%= tag.name %></h2><small><%= tag.length %> 篇文章</small><%- cg_icon('arrow') %></a><% }); %></div></section>
<% } else if (page.type === 'about') { %>
<section class="container about-page"><div class="about-intro"><p class="section-kicker">A HUMAN BEHIND THE CODE / 代码背后的人</p><div class="about-heading"><div><h1>你好，我是朝光<span>。</span></h1><p>向着太阳，也向着更好的自己。</p></div><div class="about-flower"><%- cg_flower('tracking-flower') %></div></div></div><div class="about-panorama"><span>心之所向，素履以往。</span><small>FOLLOW THE LIGHT, FIND YOUR WAY.</small></div><div class="about-body"><article class="prose"><%- page.content %></article><aside><p class="section-kicker">MY LITTLE MANIFESTO</p><div class="manifesto"><span>01</span><p>保持好奇<br><small>Stay curious.</small></p></div><div class="manifesto"><span>02</span><p>持续创造<br><small>Keep building.</small></p></div><div class="manifesto"><span>03</span><p>向光生长<br><small>Grow toward light.</small></p></div><a class="button button-primary" href="<%= url_for('/') %>#writing">看看我的记录 <%- cg_icon('arrow') %></a></aside></div></section>
<% } else { %>
<section class="container simple-page"><p class="section-kicker">LOST IN THE GARDEN</p><h1><%= page.title %></h1><article class="prose"><%- page.content %></article><a class="button button-primary" href="<%= url_for('/') %>">回到有光的地方 <%- cg_icon('right') %></a></section>
<% } %>
